  m_Name: GItem_SteamEngine
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: VoxelEngine::VoxelEngine.GridSystem.GridBlockItem
  itemId: steamengine
  displayName: Steam Engine
  description: 'A piston steam engine: vertical boiler, horizontal cylinder, crosshead,
    connecting rod and a flywheel across the frames. It produces ROTATIONAL POWER
    and nothing else - no electricity, no traction of its own. The mechanical drive
    takes the flywheel''s turn to move a train, and the brass screens tap the same
    shaft. Shovels coal (or wood) from any cargo container aboard; drinks from tank
    wagons moving and water towers berthed. Open it with E for the footplate.'
